<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, APRIL 14.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, APRIL 14.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Monday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:    April 14    April 11   Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  270.700     270.840     247.020    9.59 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  307.100     307.220     306.830    0.09 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  157.120     157.300     158.970   -1.16 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.724	46.768	47.182   -0.97 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  439.500     440.340     419.180    4.85 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.760     139.955     141.685   -1.36 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.972	15.948	16.185   -1.32 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  213.920     213.950     212.430    0.70 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.866	 1.861	 1.888   -1.17 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.573	 1.568	 1.581   -0.51 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  184.460     183.280     183.135    0.72 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
